## 🚀 Installation

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/TaxGuardX.git
cd TaxGuardX

2. Create a virtual environment

Windows

python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate

Linux / macOS
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate

3. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

4. Run TaxGuardX
python run.py

5. Open the application
Open your browser and visit:
http://127.0.0.1:5000

6. Run tests
pytest -q
